alse},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"8","right":"22","bottom":"64","left":"22","isLinked":false},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F3EEE5","css_classes":"ap-contact"},"elements":[{"id":"pcontact_pathcol1","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size_tablet":100,"_inline_size_mobile":100},"elements":[{"id":"pcontact_path1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"/></svg></span></p><p class=\"kicker\">FOR DSO NETWORKS</p><h4>DSO networks &amp; group practices</h4><p class=\"body\">You run multiple chairs across multiple locations. You&rsquo;re looking for the on-site lab that flagships in one chair, proves the math, then rolls across the network.</p><ul><li>Flagship → cluster → network rollout</li><li>$3,667 / chair / month lease, consumables separate</li><li>Custom revenue model in five business days</li></ul><p class=\"cta\"><a href=\"mailto:info@apicaldental.ai?subject=Apical%20Dental%20%E2%80%94%20DSO%20partnership%20intake\">Start DSO conversation &rarr;</a></p>","_css_classes":"ap-path","_animation":"fadeInUp","_animation_delay":220}}]},{"id":"pcontact_pathcol2","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size_tablet":100,"_inline_size_mobile":100},"elements":[{"id":"pcontact_path2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3c-2.6 0-4.2 1.4-5.1 2.9-1 1.6-1.4 3.4-1.4 5 0 1.4.4 2.7.8 4 .4 1.4.7 2.8.9 4.2.2 1.5.6 2.9 1.6 2.9 1.1 0 1.4-1.6 1.7-3.2.2-1.1.4-2.2.5-2.5.1-.3.5-.3.6 0 .1.3.3 1.4.5 2.5.3 1.6.6 3.2 1.7 3.2 1 0 1.4-1.4 1.6-2.9.2-1.4.5-2.8.9-4.2.4-1.3.8-2.6.8-4 0-1.6-.4-3.4-1.4-5C16.2 4.4 14.6 3 12 3z\"/></svg></span></p><p class=\"kicker\">FOR INDIVIDUAL PRACTITIONERS</p><h4>Independent &amp; specialty practices</h4><p class=\"body\">You&rsquo;re the practising dentist deciding for your own practice. You want the on-site lab inside your operatory, prescribed to your case mix, with the supervisor panel matched to your chair&rsquo;s case windows.</p><ul><li>Single-chair deployment with on-site Apical support</li><li>Lease structure, no hardware capex on the practice</li><li>Annual renewal · walk away if it doesn&rsquo;t fit</li></ul><p class=\"cta\"><a href=\"mailto:info@apicaldental.ai?subject=Apical%20Dental%20%E2%80%94%20independent%20practice%20intake\">Start practice conversation &rarr;</a></p>","_css_classes":"ap-path","_animation":"fadeInUp","_animation_delay":320}}]},{"id":"pcontact_pathcol3","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size_tablet":100,"_inline_size_mobile":100},"elements":[{"id":"pcontact_path3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"7\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 2v5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"2.2\" r=\"0.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M9 16.5h6\"/></svg></span></p><p class=\"kicker\">FOR ROBOTICS COMPANIES</p><h4>Robotic manufacturers &amp; platforms</h4><p class=\"body\">You build the hardware. We prescribe and supervise platforms inside dental practices &mdash; independent of any single manufacturer. Reach out about clinical validation, supervised deployments, or co-development.</p><ul><li>Manufacturer-agnostic prescriber</li><li>Clinical validation &amp; superv